Description: A reusable 'pkgdown' template based on 'Flexoki' by Steph Ango
    (2023) <https://stephango.com/flexoki>. It provides coordinated light and
    dark modes, syntax highlighting, and 'Bootstrap' component styles for
    package documentation.
